Cell["\<\
In general here results can differ, due to free MV, which can be added (\
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]LowDimension\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] algorithm not \
always yield MV with minimal determinant norm.\
\>", "Text",
