Cell["\<\
If automatic simplification above will not give the original MV, then manual \
investigation ir necessary, since Mathematica not always can compute the \
limit without help.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ec2bab24-faf1-47ed-b0a9-be8c325e73b3"],

