Cell["\<\
Important!!! Note that we are warned that roots were computed inn fact wrong \
due to precision problem. This means that gaArcCoshOfMV[ ] is also are wrong. \
After  increasing precision (see below) all is Ok\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7dbb6ccc-f699-46ac-9f0d-f0a0dd148d93"],

