Cell["\<\
Exponent  expressed in terms of RootSum yields smallest symbolic expressions. \
To demonstrate  possibilities (2022-06-10) we show option usage with simple \
MV, then we switch to general case.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.864105474169199*^9, 3.864105570015974*^9}, {
   3.8641056003307667`*^9, 3.864105619430049*^9}, {3.864106022493494*^9, 
