Cell["\<\
In super rare cases it could produce also nondiagonalizable MV. If test below \
yields, true the MV is diagonalizable, and your can proceed. If not try \
another MV\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8641051804887953`*^9, 
  3.864105338480369*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dff047bf-f6f0-4212-9654-\
431600d5a6be"],

