Cell["\<\
Now we can easily deal with defective cases. The most problematic part still \
remains computation of minimal polynomial . Therefore we always check!\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.946457602116591*^9, 3.946457660102271*^9}, {
  3.94645777207487*^9, 
  3.946457799743959*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"aa47b72e-930a-4fb7-8493-\
42a9aec3e7ae"],

